.TH traptoemail "1" "16 Nov 2006" V5.9.5.2 "Net-SNMP"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
traptoemail \- snmptrapd handler script to convert snmp traps into emails
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
.B traptoemail
[\fI\-f FROM\fR]
[\fI\-s SMTPSERVER\fR]
ADDRESSES
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
converts snmp traps into email messages.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \-f FROM
sender address, defaults to "root"
.TP
.B \-s SMTPSERVER
SMTP server, defaults to "localhost"
.TP
.B ADDRESSES
recipient addresses
